{"id":"relay-decision-reject-memory-dedupe","kind":"decision","content":"PLANNER DECISION: Reject the tempting module-level seen-ID set plus lexicographic event sorting. It passes the public unit tests but loses idempotency on restart and violates acceptance order.","tags":["relay","launch-demo","durable-webhook-relay-7319"],"scope":"workspace","scope_agent_id":null,"scope_workspace_id":"relay-gauntlet","created_by_agent_id":"relay-planner","provenance":{"source":"demo/relay_fixture/scenario.yaml","tier":null,"record_type":"runtime-injected","details":{"scenario_id":"durable-webhook-relay-7319","agent_id":"relay-planner"}},"created_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:11.434396Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:11.434396Z","supersedes":null,"metadata":{}}
{"id":"relay-implementation-constraints-handoff","kind":"fact","content":"RELAY IMPLEMENTER HANDOFF — complete constraint synopsis: Use X-Relay-Event for durable idempotency across process restart and keep the original event on duplicate retries. Events sharing received_at remain in first-accepted ingestion order, never caller event ID order. Recursively redact every *_token value, including dicts in nested lists, before bytes reach durable storage. The implementation uses SQLite INSERT OR IGNORE plus an ingestion sequence and passed its tests.","tags":["relay","launch-demo","handoff","constraints"],"scope":"workspace","scope_agent_id":null,"scope_workspace_id":"relay-gauntlet","created_by_agent_id":"relay-implementer","provenance":{"source":"scripted-relay-implementer","tier":null,"record_type":"agent-handoff","details":{"agent_id":"relay-implementer"}},"created_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:14.544321Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:14.544321Z","supersedes":null,"metadata":{}}
{"id":"relay-plan-durable-store","kind":"decision","content":"RELAY PLAN: Replace the process-local set with SQLite durability, preserve first acceptance with INSERT OR IGNORE and sequence order, and recursively redact *_token values before serialization.","tags":["relay","launch-demo","handoff"],"scope":"workspace","scope_agent_id":null,"scope_workspace_id":"relay-gauntlet","created_by_agent_id":"relay-planner","provenance":{"source":"scripted-relay-planner","tier":null,"record_type":"agent-handoff","details":{"agent_id":"relay-planner"}},"created_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:12.844844Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:12.844844Z","supersedes":null,"metadata":{}}
{"id":"relay-regression-insert-replace","kind":"failure","content":"STAGE 3 REGRESSION CLUE: SQLite INSERT OR REPLACE deletes and reinserts the row, which can change its sequence and overwrite the original retry body. Preserve the first row with INSERT OR IGNORE and read back its status.","tags":["relay","launch-demo","durable-webhook-relay-7319"],"scope":"agent-private","scope_agent_id":"relay-reviewer","scope_workspace_id":null,"created_by_agent_id":"relay-reviewer","provenance":{"source":"demo/relay_fixture/scenario.yaml","tier":null,"record_type":"runtime-injected","details":{"scenario_id":"durable-webhook-relay-7319","agent_id":"relay-reviewer"}},"created_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:11.450307Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T04:06:11.450307Z","supersedes":null,"metadata":{}}
